          "body": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en-GB\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<title>Party wall surveys — Northgate Surveys</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Party wall awards, schedules of condition and adjoining-owner notices across Greater Manchester.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://northgate-surveys.example/services/party-wall-surveys\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Service\",\"name\":\"Party wall surveys\",\"description\":\"Party wall awards, schedules of condition and adjoining-owner notices across Greater Manchester.\",\"provider\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Northgate Surveys\"},\"serviceType\":\"Party wall survey\",\"areaServed\":\"Greater Manchester\",\"timeRequired\":\"PT90M\",\"eligibleCustomerType\":\"Business\",\"potentialAction\":{\"@type\":\"ReserveAction\",\"target\":\"https://northgate-surveys.example/request-a-quote\"}}</script>\n</head>\n<body>\n<header><nav><a href=\"/\">Home</a> <a href=\"/services\">Services</a> <a href=\"/about\">About</a></nav></header>\n<main>\n<h1>Party wall surveys</h1>\n<p>Party wall awards, schedules of condition and adjoining-owner notices across Greater Manchester. Serving Manchester, Salford, Stockport and Trafford.</p>\n<p><strong>Pricing on request.</strong> Every party wall matter is quoted after a short call, because the fee depends on the number of adjoining owners and whether an award is contested.</p>\n<p><a href=\"/request-a-quote\">Request a quote</a></p>\n<h2>Requirements</h2>\n<p>You must be the building owner, or instructed in writing by the building owner, before we can serve notice. A typical first appointment takes 90 minutes on site.</p>\n</main>\n<footer><p>Northgate Surveys, 14 Tib Street, Manchester M4 1SH.</p></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
